{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17294","headline":"送殷卿罢举归淮南旧居 · 权德舆","name":"送殷卿罢举归淮南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"计偕十上竟无成，忽忆嵓居便独行。\n志业尝探绝编义，风尘虚作弃繻生。\n岁储应叹山田薄，里社诗逢野酝清。\n惆怅中年羣从少，相看欲别倍关情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}